      "message": "I agree that it was probably just simpler to follow the letter of the law when there isn\u0027t a perf gain. 20-30KB is nothing to sneeze at. Do you know if std::vector has better code size? If so, we could try moving the non-STArrays over to that and then try this? Some of these STArrays are probably dubious in terms of actually mattering for performance, too.",
